    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">A collective of musicians, DJs, producers, writers, multi-media artists, engineers, and friends, the Hot Mess world encompasses live and streaming performances, album releases, parties and events, and the occasional advertising undertaking. We’ve worked together - officially and unofficially - for over a decade, collaborating on work that brings us collective joy and brings our creative talents to the forefront.&nbsp;</span></span>",
