    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Small series of parties at The Peacock Lounge in San Francisco featuring DJs spinning psychedelic house, disco, funk, and soul.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nWe believe dancing is good for your soul. It's easier to find music to dance to at 2am than it is at 8pm. That shouldn't be the case. &nbsp;</span></span>",
